      "detail": "Stamp duty about €3,500."
    },
    {
      "text": "Ground-floor bedroom with en suite",
      "weight": 3,
      "detail": "The main bedroom (4.1 × 4.9 m, dual aspect, door to the garden) and its en suite are on the ground floor, plus a separate ground-floor bathroom."
    },
    {
      "text": "Village school 660 m away",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "Ballyduff NS, 64 pupils (multi-grade classes); Camolin NS (4.3 km) is the fallback. Gorey Community School is the secondary, ~14 km."
    },
    {
      "text": "Private site already set up for dogs",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "0.6 acres, secluded and tree-lined, with a dog pen and timber shed."
    },
    {
      "text": "Character and kept up",
      "weight": 1,
      "detail": "Exposed stone, timber floors, feature fireplace and a freestanding stove; presented as move-in ready."
    },
    {
      "text": "Holiday-let appeal",
      "weight": 1,
      "detail": "A characterful cottage 20 minutes from the Wexford coast lets well in summer."
    },
    {
      "text": "Fibre broadband available",
      "weight": 1,
      "detail": "Third-party report shows full fibre at the address; confirm with the agent."
    }
  ],
  "cons": [
    {
      "text": "Compact: 115 m², effectively a 2-bed plus",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "Above the 100 m² floor, but Bedroom 2 is the landing; a third proper bedroom or a kitchen-living extension is a rough €80–120k."
    },
    {
      "text": "0.6 acres, under the acre",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "Enough for a fenced run, but short of the 1-acre ideal for two vizslas."
    },
    {
      "text": "BER E1 with electric heating",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "Expensive to run. A heat pump and insulation is a rough €30–50k before grants."
    },
    {
      "text": "Not walkable",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "Ballyduff is a crossroads with a school; Camolin's shop is 4 km and everything else is a drive."
    },
    {
      "text": "ED about 35–40 minutes",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "Wexford General is the nearest 24-hour emergency department. See the 3 a.m. trip below."
    },
    {
      "text": "Train is a drive and infrequent",
      "weight": 1,
      "detail": "Gorey station about 15 minutes away; about 5 direct trains a day, fastest 1h43 to Connolly."
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, septic and radon",
      "weight": 1,
      "detail": "Private well and septic tank; the area is EPA high-radon, so test before buying (remediation a rough €800–2,000)."
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiny kitchen and small rooms",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "Kitchen 2.7 × 2.1 m, sitting room 2.5 × 3.8 m; family life needs a new kitchen-living extension, not just more bedrooms."
    }
